  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_akafyu",
      "name": {
        "en": "Akafuyu's Badge",
        "zh": "赤冬证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_akafyu",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Akafuyu has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for solo confrontation with the enemy while far removed from support lines.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Guard Operator during field operations to exercise Musha responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员赤冬擅长远离支援独自面对敌人\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为近卫干员，行使武者职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_akafyu",
      "name": {
        "en": "Samurai Armor",
        "zh": "武将甲胄",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_akafyu",
      "description": {
        "en": "Kirara glances at Akafuyu sitting in front of the TV.\n'Why are you suddenly so interested in this thing? You've been stealing looks at it.' Akafuyu doesn't turn around, but simply removes a shoulder guard with one hand and tosses it to Kirara. Her eyesight may be poor, but she's so aware of her surroundings, she might as well have a camera in her back.\n'This armor...'\n'It's an heirloom. It's not valuable. My master doesn't go out to fight much, so it was bequeathed to me.'\n'Um, the design...'\n'It's a very special shape to the armor. In the old days, each family had its own style.'\nKirara touches the shoulder guard and compares it to the armor in her game. She starts to think the developers must know of Akafuyu.\n'Someone asked me almost the same question before, a little girl about your age. She would ask me under her breath, 'Captain, is your armor made of some high-tech material? Can it really withstand a grenade blast?' Ha, she might have thought I was some antique.'\n'So, can it?'\n'Don't be a fool. It's hard, sure, but it's just a piece of metal. You'd do better training hard and listening to your commander. She knew that, of course. Still, this armor has saved me plenty of times. Look, the pit that jumps right out at you there, that crossbow bolt almost pierced clean through my arm. Oh, and she was there in the last battle, standing next to me. Damned near died.'\nKirara suddenly loses interest in the topic.\nThe heavy feeling on her knees reminds her that this shoulder guard is supposed to be unique, representing an era of glory passed from one generation to the next, still thick with the stench of war and sacrifice.\nBut now, it's a rare item in a popular game, and any player can get it, if they pay enough.\nAkafuyu stands up. Kirara decides to hurry over and take out the freshly purchased game disc before Akafuyu notices.\n'By the way, do you have a minute?' Akafuyu walks towards her, 'I just killed the final boss without taking any damage. Can you upload the recording to that forum you like? Oh, and put my name on it, so you-know-who doesn't miss it...'\nKirara only now notices the game on the screen. The main character is holding a wooden sword with the lowest ATK, wearing almost no armor, except... the piece currently resting on her knees.\n'Does it... bother you?'\n'What? Oh, that it's my armor? If someday the people of Higashi know it from a game, rather then from a battlefield... then it can only mean that the war is finally over.' Akafuyu takes back the shoulder guard and slots it neatly into place, 'I've waited too long for that day.'",
        "zh": "绮良瞄了一眼电视机跟前的赤冬。\n“你怎么突然对这玩意儿感兴趣，看了一眼又一眼？”赤冬没回头，用一只手把肩甲解了下来，抛给绮良。她眼神不好，可敏锐得像在背上装了摄像头。\n“这甲胄……”\n“祖传的。不是什么贵重的东西，大人不怎么上前线了，就送给了我。”\n“那个，款式……”\n“形制是比较特殊，以前的规矩，一家一个样式呗。”\n绮良摸着那片肩甲，又比对了下游戏里的甲胄。她想，做游戏的人一定认识赤冬。\n“以前也有人问过差不多的问题，一个小姑娘，年纪和你差不多大。她一开始还偷偷问我，‘队长，你这甲胄是什么高科技材料做的吗，真能挡住榴弹？’呵，她那时可能以为我是什么老古董。”\n“所以，能吗？”\n“废话，它再硬也就是个金属片。指望它还不如好好训练，多听长官的话。这道理她也懂。不过这甲胄还是救过我很多次的。你看看，就最明显那个坑，那根弩箭差点射穿了我的胳膊。对了，最后那一仗，她也在，就站在我旁边，差点死了。”\n绮良突然不再好奇这件事了。\n膝盖上沉甸甸的感觉提醒着她，这肩甲本是独一无二的，代表着一段代代相传的荣耀，至今仍散发着战火与牺牲的味道。\n而现在它却成了热门游戏中的一个稀有道具，玩家只要花钱就能拥有。\n赤冬刚好站了起来。绮良决定，趁赤冬没发现，等她转身，自己就冲过去把新买的光盘拿走。\n“说到这个，你有时间吗？”赤冬却走向了她，“我刚砍的关底大怪，无伤，你帮我把录屏传到那个你最常去的论坛上。对了，记得用我名字，以免那家伙注意不到……”\n绮良这才注意到，电视屏幕上就是那个游戏。主角拿着攻击力最低的木剑，几乎什么防具都没穿，除了……她膝上的甲胄。\n“你……不介意？”\n“介意什么？哦，你说我的甲胄？要是哪天所有东国人认识它都是从游戏里，而不是在战场上的话……那只能说明，战争终于结束了。”赤冬拿回肩甲，穿戴整齐，“那样的日子，我可等太久了。”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
